"check tomorrow's calendar" was not sent to the Persona main conversation: Persona did not hear a new request from the user since the last thing you were told about an agent's work (or they had not spoken in the last half minute), so it held it back to be safe. Tell the user in one sentence that you didn't hear a fresh request from them since the last result (or lately), so you held it back to be safe; if they want it done, they can say it again. Do not make it sound as if someone else said it.